  "Title": "R interface to EBI MGnify metagenomics resource",
  "Description": "MGnifyR is an R interface to MGnify, EBI's resource for\nthe analysis of metagenomic, metatranscriptomic and amplicon\ndata. It searches MGnify studies, samples and analyses with\nMGnify API v2, and fetches their taxonomic and functional\nprofiles together with sample metadata. The data is returned as\nTreeSummarizedExperiment or MultiAssayExperiment, so that it\ncan be analysed directly with Bioconductor microbiome tools.",
